</code>

This is the output for the last method where the assert statement is placed.
The assert statement `Debug.Assert(New_Ret >= Old_arrListLastIndexOfX - 1);` is placed to ensure that the index returned by the `IndexOf()` method is at least 1 less than the index in the original list. This is because `IndexOf()` returns the zero-based index of the first occurrence of the given value.--------------------
using System.Diagnostics;

